#
# iso-eda keymap preset: Virtuoso-style (docs/PLAN.md: "Bindkey presets:
# Virtuoso-style and xschem-style"). Same format as xschem.keymap.
# Differs from it the way Cadence's own defaults differ from xschem's:
# redo on Ctrl+Y rather than Ctrl+Shift+Z, and no Shift on the palette
# binding.
ctrl+p = ui.open_palette
ctrl+z = edit.undo
ctrl+y = edit.redo
ctrl+l = view.toggle_theme
ctrl+h = app.hello
